{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026J9pymFAuSB1795238251.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>受乾燥的東北季候風影響，大部分地區的相對濕度下降至百分之40左右。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-1300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026SiINmsJOT81795238265.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>中午時分，天色晴朗，市區氣溫普遍回升至20度或以上。天文台表示，下午部分時間有陽光及非常乾燥，今晚大致多雲。</p><p></p><p>隨著一股達強風程度的偏東氣流，下周初影響華南沿岸，氣溫會略為回升。但下周二，受另一股東北季候風影響，本港氣溫會再度下降及有幾陣雨。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T06:14:56.773959+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T05:09:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T06:08:19.649993+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T06:08:19.649993+00:00","content_hash":"e6bff5cb34a37b463887f062a5f8522117410648c8bc4cbed0b08d05be9eeb7e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}